                                                "sense_id": "1b004715-194c-3ecf-85d5-25fff34a853a",
                                                "text": "The hope , however , is a slight one , and most attempts to love end in frustration : even Singer cannot endure the thought of life without Antonapoulos . The next most selfless seeker after love and happiness is Mick , who longs to express herself and to communicate with others through music, and her failure is pathetic because[…]"
